~ start
if first_interaction:
	=> first_interaction
else:
	=> regular
	
~ first_interaction
do set_avatar("porkpaglu")
PorkPaglu: Happy birthday Sreejita!
do set_avatar("sree")
You: Thank You!
do set_avatar("porkpaglu")
PorkPaglu: Congragulations on being one year closer to being a Grandma.
do set_avatar("sree")
You: You are also very cose to being a Granpa soon
do set_avatar("porkpaglu")
PorkPaglu: Yeah yeah whatever.
PorkPaglu: Btw, the cake was just "Shera"!
do set_avatar("sree")
You: All credits to my mom and her secret bakery
do set_avatar("porkpaglu")
PorkPaglu: Cake was good, but you could have kept pork and octopus on the lunch menu as well.
do set_avatar("sree")
You: .....
You: You keep that on the menu in your own birthday party.
do set_avatar("porkpaglu")
PorkPaglu: Anyways, here is my staple gift, a perfume because I can't think of anything better.

do Ui.gift_box.give_gift("perfume")

do set_avatar("sree")
You: Very beautiful and cute scent, thank you!
do set_avatar("porkpaglu")
PorkPaglu: My perfume choice is always perfect.
PorkPaglu: Before going out wear this and guys will surround you like bees
do set_avatar("sree")
You: No need, I will wear it for its scent, I have no interest in guys surrounding me.

set first_interaction = false
do EventManager.finish_task(EventManager.task_ids.talk_to_porkpaglu)
=> END

~ regular
do set_avatar("porkpaglu")
%1 PorkPaglu: Very much missing some pork and sea food.
%1 PorkPaglu: The cake was so tasty, it's taste is still lingering.
%1 PorkPaglu: Give feedback on the perfume, if you were surrounded by guys or not
=> END